        "title": "Made after you order",
        "body": "We cut and sew each piece after the order comes in."
      },
      {
        "title": "You choose both fabrics",
        "body": "One fabric for the main part of the piece, one for the lining or trim."
      },
      {
        "title": "Questions go to LivLocal",
        "body": "Not sure about a size or fabric pairing? Send a message before ordering and we’ll help you sort it out."
      }
