    "howItWorks": [
      {
        "step": "Pick the piece",
        "body": "Start with a children’s dress, quilted bag, or Bible bag."
      },
      {
        "step": "Choose your size and fabrics",
        "body": "Pick your size, then a primary and a secondary fabric."
      },
      {
        "step": "LivLocal makes it",
        "body": "Your order is cut and sewn, then shipped when it is finished."
      }
    ],
    "fabricSectionTitle": "Pick two fabrics",
    "fabricSectionBody": "Choose a primary fabric for the main part of the piece and a secondary fabric for the lining, trim, ties, or contrast details. If you need help pairing them, send us a message before ordering.",
    "aboutTitle": "Hi, I’m Olivia.",
    "aboutBody": [
      "I make homemade, personalized children’s clothes, quilted bags, Bible accessories, and more, all from my home studio in Southeast Iowa.",
      "I’ve always been passionate about sewing, and I’ve taken the step to start selling what I make.",
      "I cut, sew, and press every piece myself, and every order is made one at a time. What arrives was made for the person who asked for it.",
      "I’m adding new pieces as I go. If you want something different from what is listed, send me a message and I’ll tell you what is possible."
    ],
    "ctaBandTitle": "Need a different size or fabric?",
